From: MC Proxy maintainers
Subject: Port public fingerprint identity controls to ungoogled Chromium 150

Derived from public fingerprint-chromium148 patches 000/002/005/014/018
(commit 13b89eae304123f0710f2d33fd0816a2f61d7ffc). Applies after the pinned
ungoogled150 patch series. Includes explicit target dependencies and shared
Navigator/UA metadata inheritance for Dedicated and Shared Workers.
Device memory keeps Chromium's shared approximation for Navigator and HTTP
Client Hints; the old seed-only Navigator override is deliberately omitted.
Native compilation/runtime acceptance still required.

